window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-matsushita-chiaki"]=[{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v7_5-p65-1","v":"y1v7.5","y":1,"o":9,"k":"spoken","w":"shinohara-satsuki satou-maya hirata-yousuke matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 3  the boyfriends chat walking with satou and shinohara through keyaki mall on winter break   well  we weren t able to get ourselves boyfriends before christmas  huh  said matsushita  looking at all the couples   i m not willing to settle   since we ve done nothing but fight with the other classes  we haven t had any free time to make friends  maybe it s better to try going out with the seniors  you know  though a university student would be even better   was he messing with you again  ugh  why s our class full of idiots  asked matsushita  walks with her  teases her looks  later asks what ike did  same walk   karuizawa san s already claimed the only real prize    hirata named by implication","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v7_5-p65-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: the boyfriends chat<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7.5 · p.65, 69<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walking with Satou and Shinohara through Keyaki Mall on winter break.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Well, we weren’t able to get ourselves boyfriends before Christmas, huh?” said Matsushita, looking at all the couples.<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’m not willing to settle.”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Since we’ve done nothing but fight with the other classes, we haven’t had any free time to make friends. Maybe it’s better to try going out with the seniors, you know? Though a university student would be even better,”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Was he messing with you again? Ugh. Why’s our class full of idiots?” asked Matsushita.<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> Walks with her; teases her looks; later asks what Ike did.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–69<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Same walk.<span class=\"pg\">p.65–69<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> “Karuizawa-san’s already claimed the only real prize.” — Hirata named by implication.<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11-p359-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke katsuragi-kouhei matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 7  flash mental arithmetic is selected by ayanokoji for the flash mental arithmetic event and wears the headset for commander intervention  answers the early questions correctly while koenji does not participate  keeps up through the sixth question but cannot solve the later  harder questions  writes down ayanokoji s answer for the final question  but class a still wins the event  receives his intervention on the final question  competes alongside him as he refuses to participate seriously  competes against him in the event","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11-p359-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: Flash Mental Arithmetic<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.359–365<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Is selected by Ayanokōji for the Flash Mental Arithmetic event and wears the headset for commander intervention. Answers the early questions correctly while Kōenji does not participate. Keeps up through the sixth question but cannot solve the later, harder questions. Writes down Ayanokōji’s answer for the final question, but Class A still wins the event.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"kouenji-rokusuke.html\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/a> · <a href=\"katsuragi-kouhei.html\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Receives his intervention on the final question.<span class=\"pg\">p.359–365<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kōenji Rokusuke<\/b> Competes alongside him as he refuses to participate seriously.<span class=\"pg\">p.359–364<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Katsuragi Kōhei<\/b> Competes against him in the event.<span class=\"pg\">p.359–365<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p296-1","v":"y1v11.5","y":1,"o":14,"k":"inner","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shinohara-satsuki satou-maya tsukishiro matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 5  suspicion and pursuit during spring break  matsushita reflects on her suspicions about ayanokoji kiyotaka and decides to investigate him   sure enough  this interests me  she considers class d s situation and concludes that hidden capable students like ayanokoji could change their prospects  matsushita recalls observations that led her to suspect ayanokoji  including his relationships and performance in key events  at keyaki mall  she meets shinohara and sato and steers the conversation toward ayanokoji  sato tells matsushita and shinohara that she confessed to ayanokoji and was rejected  matsushita listens as sato shares her belief that ayanokoji and karuizawa like each other  after spotting ayanokoji at the mall  matsushita follows him while pretending to be on her phone  she observes ayanokoji speaking with acting director tsukishiro from a distance  after ayanokoji confronts her for following him  matsushita admits she tailed him and questions him about hiding his strength  she cites the mental arithmetic event and seeing him with hirata during the class vote as reasons for her suspicion  matsushita accepts ayanokoji s explanation for the moment and agrees not to tell anyone about him and karuizawa  suspects he is hiding his abilities  follows him  and confronts him  meets and talks with her at the mall  hears about her confession to ayanokoji  observes his conversation with ayanokoji from afar","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p296-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5: Suspicion and pursuit<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11.5 · p.296–323, 339–351<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">During spring break, Matsushita reflects on her suspicions about Ayanokōji Kiyotaka and decides to investigate him. She considers Class D’s situation and concludes that hidden capable students like Ayanokōji could change their prospects. Matsushita recalls observations that led her to suspect Ayanokōji, including his relationships and performance in key events. At Keyaki mall, she meets Shinohara and Satō and steers the conversation toward Ayanokōji. Satō tells Matsushita and Shinohara that she confessed to Ayanokōji and was rejected. Matsushita listens as Satō shares her belief that Ayanokōji and Karuizawa like each other. After spotting Ayanokōji at the mall, Matsushita follows him while pretending to be on her phone. She observes Ayanokōji speaking with Acting Director Tsukishiro from a distance. After Ayanokōji confronts her for following him, Matsushita admits she tailed him and questions him about hiding his strength. She cites the mental arithmetic event and seeing him with Hirata during the Class Vote as reasons for her suspicion. Matsushita accepts Ayanokōji’s explanation for the moment and agrees not to tell anyone about him and Karuizawa.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q inner\">“Sure enough, this interests me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.296<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Suspects he is hiding his abilities, follows him, and confronts him.<span class=\"pg\">p.296–305, 320–323, 339–351<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> Meets and talks with her at the mall.<span class=\"pg\">p.306–319<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Hears about her confession to Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.306–319<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Observes his conversation with Ayanokōji from afar.<span class=\"pg\">p.321–323<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p296-2\">→ After: Depth review: Matsushita&#x27;s suspicion (her POV)<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p296-2","v":"y1v11.5","y":1,"o":14,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki depth review  matsushita s suspicion  her pov  matsushita decides  in first person narration  to investigate ayanokoji   not out of love but vigilance   sure enough  this interests me   no  that s impossible   i was tormented by that thought until ayanokouji kun appeared right in front of my eyes   i want to understand the mystery behind his strength   and if his strength is true   there s no reason not to make use of it    just kidding  deduced from karuizawa dating him  his ties to horikita hirata ichinose  and sakayanagi organising class a to give him protection points that he possesses hidden strength  sees herself as a top 10  student who hid her ability in class d to avoid jealousy and over reliance  wants a stable route to class a  driven also by boredom and a desire for the  thrill of life  not only class advancement  intends to draw out his true nature under the guise of curiosity and make him cooperate  read karuizawa s dating choice as evidence of ayanokoji s hidden strength","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p296-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Depth review: Matsushita&#x27;s suspicion (her POV)<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11.5 · p.296–305<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Matsushita decides, in first-person narration, to investigate Ayanokōji — not out of love but vigilance.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Sure enough, this interests me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.296<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;No, that&#x27;s impossible.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.298<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I was tormented by that thought until Ayanokouji-kun appeared right in front of my eyes.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I want to understand the mystery behind his strength.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.304<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;And if his strength is true ── there&#x27;s no reason not to make use of it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.304<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;… Just kidding.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.305<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> Deduced from Karuizawa dating him, his ties to Horikita/Hirata/Ichinose, and Sakayanagi organising Class A to give him protection points that he possesses hidden strength.<span class=\"pg\">p.301–302<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Sees herself as a top-10% student who hid her ability in Class D to avoid jealousy and over-reliance; wants a stable route to Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.297–300<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Driven also by boredom and a desire for the &quot;thrill of life,&quot; not only class advancement.<span class=\"pg\">p.305<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Intends to draw out his true nature under the guise of curiosity and make him cooperate.<span class=\"pg\">p.296–305<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Read Karuizawa&#x27;s dating choice as evidence of Ayanokōji&#x27;s hidden strength.<span class=\"pg\">p.301<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p296-1\">← Before: Ch.5: Suspicion and pursuit<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p374-1\">→ After: Short story: Mind Games<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p374-1","v":"y1v11.5","y":1,"o":14,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka tsukishiro matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki short story  mind games in her short story perspective  matsushita recounts following ayanokoji and being caught when he confronts her  she describes trying to question him about his conversation with acting director tsukishiro and about the end of year exam  matsushita recalls pressing him on his performance in the mental arithmetic event and his reasons for hiding his ability  recounts confronting him about his abilities  mentions observing his conversation with ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p374-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Short story: Mind Games<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11.5 · p.374–377<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In her short story perspective, Matsushita recounts following Ayanokōji and being caught when he confronts her. She describes trying to question him about his conversation with Acting Director Tsukishiro and about the end-of-year exam. Matsushita recalls pressing him on his performance in the mental arithmetic event and his reasons for hiding his ability.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"tsukishiro.html\">Tsukishiro<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Recounts confronting him about his abilities.<span class=\"pg\">p.374–377<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tsukishiro<\/b> Mentions observing his conversation with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.375<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y1v11_5-p296-2\">← Before: Depth review: Matsushita&#x27;s suspicion (her POV)<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v1-p221-1","v":"y2v1","y":2,"o":16,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki epilogue  mention mentioned as a talented student","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v1-p221-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V1 · p.221<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mentioned as a talented student.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p178-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita proposes cooperation to ayanokoji she approaches him with her contact info  proposing they cooperate during the exam  he keeps his options open   i do  that s why i think it s important for me to cooperate with you to help  strategic and proactive   she seeks alliances early  she proposes cooperation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p178-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita proposes cooperation to Ayanokōji<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.178–184<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She approaches him with her contact info, proposing they cooperate during the exam; he keeps his options open.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I do. That&#x27;s why I think it&#x27;s important for me to cooperate with you to help&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Strategic and proactive — she seeks alliances early.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She proposes cooperation.<span class=\"pg\">p.178–184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p182-1\">→ After: Matsushita&#x27;s offer to group with Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p182-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita s offer to group with ayanokoji  if you ve got any problems  i would like to help you  ayanokouji kun   did you judge that your odds of survival are the highest if you grouped up   i thought you d get snapped up quickly  ayanokouji kun  shrewd and calculating   holds a  trial card  that makes a group more likely to be expelled  yet offers to assist ayanokoji despite the danger  explains she chose him because she thought he d be snapped up quickly and preferred taking the risk with capable people over a  half assed group  with friends  offers to group with him  he declines to decide immediately  suspecting she is scheming","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p182-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita&#x27;s offer to group with Ayanokōji<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.182–184<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If you&#x27;ve got any problems, I would like to help you, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.182<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Did you judge that your odds of survival are the highest if you grouped up&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I thought you&#x27;d get snapped up quickly, Ayanokouji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Shrewd and calculating — holds a &quot;trial card&quot; that makes a group more likely to be expelled, yet offers to assist Ayanokōji despite the danger; explains she chose him because she thought he&#x27;d be snapped up quickly and preferred taking the risk with capable people over a &quot;half-assed group&quot; with friends.<span class=\"pg\">p.182–184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Offers to group with him; he declines to decide immediately, suspecting she is scheming.<span class=\"pg\">p.182–184<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v2-p178-1\">← Before: Matsushita proposes cooperation to Ayanokōji<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p127-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki mentions  the skeptic surge  starting with matsushita  many students had become skeptical of my abilities","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p127-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Mentions: the skeptic surge<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.127<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;Starting with Matsushita, many students had become skeptical of my abilities.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.127<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p168-1\">→ After: Mentions: she knew<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p168-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki mentions  she knew matsushita was aware of the relationship   sato told her  her behaviour confirms it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p168-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Mentions: she knew<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.168<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Matsushita was aware of the relationship — Satō told her; her behaviour confirms it.<span class=\"pg\">p.168<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p127-1\">← Before: Mentions: the skeptic surge<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p172-1\">→ After: Matsushita latches onto the treasure hunt<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p172-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"spoken","w":"tatara ayanokouji-kiyotaka satou-maya matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita latches onto the treasure hunt spots ayanokoji under the sofa  invites him to pair up when she realizes he s alone  sits in on his qr code pattern lecture  doesn t understand a word of the reasoning but contributes logistics  departs for  a slightly more dependable partner   ayanokoji  huh    unattributed in the translation  by position it is tatara s  but it is not assigned as his   hey  are you perhaps alone too  ayanokoji kun  if you re alone  do you want to pair up   pretty much   naturally  there will be valuable qr codes in hard to find locations  right   it s a lot of work to put up a hundred qr codes  right   but yeah  that s too bad  to think someone beat me to it    unattributed in the translation  follows ayanokoji s inward remark  by position it is either his or matsushita s  not assigned   i think i m going to go look for a slightly more dependable partner  see you later  tatara trails her  she is completely oblivious to what he is  ayanokoji never tells her  does not notice tatara s interest  the encounter ends without friction  invites him  he deflects  she gives up gracefully  joins their conversation about the qr pattern  puzzled but game","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p172-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita latches onto the treasure hunt<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.172–176<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Spots Ayanokōji under the sofa; invites him to pair up when she realizes he&#x27;s alone; sits in on his QR-code pattern lecture; doesn&#x27;t understand a word of the reasoning but contributes logistics; departs for &quot;a slightly more dependable partner.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"index.html#tatara\">Tatara<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hey, are you perhaps alone too, Ayanokōji-kun? If you&#x27;re alone, do you want to pair up?”<span class=\"pg\">p.173<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Pretty much.”<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Naturally, there will be valuable QR codes in hard to find locations, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “…Ayanokōji, huh” — unattributed in the translation; by position it is Tatara&#x27;s, but it is not assigned as his.<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It&#x27;s a lot of work to put up a hundred QR codes, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.175<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “But yeah, that&#x27;s too bad. To think someone beat me to it.” — unattributed in the translation; follows Ayanokōji&#x27;s inward remark; by position it is either his or Matsushita&#x27;s; not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I think I&#x27;m going to go look for a slightly more dependable partner. See you later.”<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Tatara trails her; she is completely oblivious to what he is; Ayanokōji never tells her.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–174<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Tatara<\/b> Does not notice Tatara&#x27;s interest; the encounter ends without friction.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–174<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Invites him; he deflects; she gives up gracefully.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Joins their conversation about the QR pattern; puzzled but game.<span class=\"pg\">p.172–176<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p168-1\">← Before: Mentions: she knew<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p218-1\">→ After: Mentions: the cross-mind<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p218-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki mentions  the cross mind  the fact that i paired up with sato  who d once confessed to me  and had a chat with matsushita also crossed my mind   numerous people would ve seen us  even matsushita knew about it","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p218-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Mentions: the cross-mind<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.218, 220<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;the fact that I paired up with Satō, who&#x27;d once confessed to me, and had a chat with Matsushita also crossed my mind.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.218<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;numerous people would&#x27;ve seen us. Even Matsushita knew about it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.220<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v4_5-p172-1\">← Before: Matsushita latches onto the treasure hunt<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p18-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"spoken","w":"satou-maya asahina-nazuna horikita-suzune matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita  the budget conscious maid cafe planner  but  oh  i don t mean to say anything bad about the current idea  but i think some people will be reluctant to do anything if they have to pay for it themselves   about four days of preparation  i think the cost i incurred is surprisingly reasonable  all in all  13 200 private points  the three of us here and maezono planned it and split the cost  so it s 3 300 points per person  dressed as a maid for the  maimai  maid cafe demonstration  tableware is their own  no cost    she kept the event cheap on purpose  co planner  dressed as a maid alongside her  pocketed the praise  pokes mii chan s side too  p 24  mii chan wrote the three page proposal  both poke her side when praised  p 24  defended her own numbers under horikita s interrogation  ayanokoji notes privately that  for now that i ve got sato and matsushita down  the waitress list can be built","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p18-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita: the budget-conscious maid-café planner<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.18, 22–25<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Dressed as a maid for the &quot;Maimai&quot; maid-café demonstration; tableware is their own (no cost) — she kept the event cheap on purpose.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"asahina-nazuna.html\">Asahina Nazuna<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;But... Oh, I don&#x27;t mean to say anything bad about the current idea, but I think some people will be reluctant to do anything if they have to pay for it themselves.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;About four days of preparation. I think the cost I incurred is surprisingly reasonable. All in all, 13,200 private points. The three of us here and Maezono planned it and split the cost, so it&#x27;s 3,300 points per person.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Co-planner; dressed as a maid alongside her; pocketed the praise (pokes Mii-chan&#x27;s side too, p.24).<span class=\"pg\">p.22–24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Asahina Nazuna<\/b> Mii-chan wrote the three-page proposal; both poke her side when praised (p.24).<span class=\"pg\">p.23–24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Defended her own numbers under Horikita&#x27;s interrogation.<span class=\"pg\">p.22–24<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Ayanokōji notes privately that &quot;for now that I&#x27;ve got Satō and Matsushita down&quot; the waitress list can be built.<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p54-1\">→ After: Coverage-gate mention record<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p54-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki coverage gate mention record  she might even be able to beat them    haruka discusses matsushita with ayanokoji  no  if you include her physical characteristics  she might even be able to beat them    the plan queen","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p54-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Coverage-gate mention record<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.54<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;she might even be able to beat them&quot; — Haruka discusses Matsushita with Ayanokōji (&quot;No, if you include her physical characteristics, she might even be able to beat them.&quot; — the plan queen).<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p18-1\">← Before: Matsushita: the budget-conscious maid-café planner<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p172-1\">→ After: Matsushita: caught in the fallout<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p172-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita  caught in the fallout eye contact interrogation   she answered like everyone else   karuizawa  matsushita  mori and others laughed  at shinohara s suitors   named in kushida s spear","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p172-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita: caught in the fallout<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.172, 206<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Eye-contact interrogation — she answered like everyone else.<span class=\"pg\">p.172<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;Karuizawa, Matsushita, Mori and others laughed&quot; at Shinohara&#x27;s suitors — named in Kushida&#x27;s spear.<span class=\"pg\">p.206<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v5-p54-1\">← Before: Coverage-gate mention record<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p26-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka shinohara-satsuki karuizawa-kei mori-nene ike-kanji matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 1  greets him  the weekend arrangements collapse she approaches him happily    good morning  ayanokouji kun    the first time she has called out to him just for showing up to class  she rates his abilities highly after the expulsion  she interprets his state of mind better than horikita does  the problem is shinohara  haruka  mii chan and kushida   good morning  ayanokouji kun   so  at long last you ve started working towards rising to class a   there might be a lot going on for a while  but i don t think you need to worry about it   although  considering it s you  you probably aren t worried at all   the important thing here isn t you or horikita san  right   this weekend  i d made a bunch of arrangements  but she canceled all of a sudden   girls tend to hold on to things like that for long   well  it s our fault  though   this sort of thing is like an everyday affair for us  i ve faced more troublesome situations before this too  she and kei and mori are the ones who made fun of kei and shinohara as a couple   behind her back  shinohara is not talking to her  that is why her weekend arrangements collapsed  she greets him openly  sizes up his state of mind  talks shinohara s cancellation through  the arrangee of the cancelled weekend  not talking to matsushita since the couple making fun incident  kei was one of the couple making fun people behind shinohara s back  mori was one of the couple making fun people behind shinohara s back  ike was the other half of the couple at the center of the incident","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Greets him; the weekend arrangements collapse<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.26–28<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She approaches him happily — “Good morning, Ayanokouji-kun!” — the first time she has called out to him just for showing up to class; she rates his abilities highly after the expulsion; she interprets his state of mind better than Horikita does (the problem is Shinohara, Haruka, Mii-chan and Kushida). She and Kei and Mori are the ones who made fun of Kei and Shinohara as a couple — behind her back; Shinohara is not talking to her; that is why her weekend arrangements collapsed.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"mori-nene.html\">Mori Nene<\/a> · <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Good morning, Ayanokouji-kun!”<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“So, at long last you’ve started working towards rising to Class A?”<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“There might be a lot going on for a while, but I don’t think you need to worry about it.”<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Although, considering it’s you, you probably aren’t worried at all.”<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The important thing here isn’t you or Horikita-san, right?”<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “This weekend, I’d made a bunch of arrangements, but she canceled all of a sudden.”<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Girls tend to hold on to things like that for long.”<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, it’s our fault, though.”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “This sort of thing is like an everyday affair for us. I’ve faced more troublesome situations before this too.”<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She greets him openly; sizes up his state of mind; talks Shinohara&#x27;s cancellation through.<span class=\"pg\">p.26–28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> The arrangee of the cancelled weekend; not talking to Matsushita since the couple-making-fun incident.<span class=\"pg\">p.27–28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Kei was one of the couple-making-fun people behind Shinohara&#x27;s back.<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mori Nene<\/b> Mori was one of the couple-making-fun people behind Shinohara&#x27;s back.<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Ike was the other half of the couple at the center of the incident.<span class=\"pg\">p.28<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p44-1\">→ After: Ch.1: Her weekend group backed Hirata&#x27;s no-leak request<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p44-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke kushida-kikyou matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 1  her weekend group backed hirata s no leak request  i wouldn t have spoken about it even if hirata kun hadn t asked me to  our group met up over the weekend  and we got to talking about how  like  even if we let this leak  it wouldn t be good  of course  i m not saying we don t have our own thoughts about kushida san   i wouldn t have spoken about it even if hirata kun hadn t asked me to  our group met up over the weekend  and we got to talking about how  like  even if we let this leak  it wouldn t be good  of course  i m not saying we don t have our own thoughts about kushida san  she backs his no leak request  her weekend group agreed with his  she has her own thoughts about kushida  but backs the secrecy line","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p44-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Her weekend group backed Hirata&#x27;s no-leak request<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.44–44<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">“I wouldn’t have spoken about it even if Hirata-kun hadn’t asked me to. Our group met up over the weekend, and we got to talking about how, like, even if we let this leak, it wouldn’t be good. Of course, I’m not saying we don’t have our own thoughts about Kushida-san.”<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I wouldn’t have spoken about it even if Hirata-kun hadn’t asked me to. Our group met up over the weekend, and we got to talking about how, like, even if we let this leak, it wouldn’t be good. Of course, I’m not saying we don’t…”<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I wouldn’t have spoken about it even if Hirata-kun hadn’t asked me to. Our group met up over the weekend, and we got to talking about how, like, even if we let this leak, it wouldn’t be good. Of course, I’m not saying we don’t have our own thoughts about Kushida-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> She backs his no-leak request; her weekend group agreed with his.<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> She has her own thoughts about Kushida, but backs the secrecy line.<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p26-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Greets him; the weekend arrangements collapse<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p58-1\">→ After: Ch.1: Maid café; not talking to Shinohara<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p58-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"","w":"satou-maya maezono shinohara-satsuki matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 1  maid cafe  not talking to shinohara she is one of the maid cafe originators   ak has asked the originators for a pause  there is no sign she has learned of it yet  she is one of the people shinohara is not talking to   the couple incident s fallout still runs through the class  fellow maid cafe originator  fellow maid cafe originator  shinohara still not talking to her   the couple incident s fallout","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p58-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Maid café; not talking to Shinohara<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.58–60<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She is one of the maid café originators — AK has asked the originators for a pause; there is no sign she has learned of it yet. She is one of the people Shinohara is not talking to — the couple incident&#x27;s fallout still runs through the class.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a> · <a href=\"shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Fellow maid café originator.<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> Fellow maid café originator.<span class=\"pg\">p.58<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> Shinohara still not talking to her — the couple incident&#x27;s fallout.<span class=\"pg\">p.60<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p44-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Her weekend group backed Hirata&#x27;s no-leak request<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p73-1\">→ After: Ch.2: The secretary of the Shinohara situation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p73-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"","w":"karuizawa-kei shinohara-satsuki matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 2  the secretary of the shinohara situation ak narrates  matsushita had already given him a brief explanation of the shinohara fallout   he also has to hear it from kei as well  the  kei  matsushita  mori and the rest  trio   kushida s leak about their making fun of her appearance got behind shinohara  matsushita and mori may soon face a flipped campaign   shinohara s friends might openly bad mouth  kei  matsushita  mori and the rest  kei is the one whose shinohara situation is explained in parallel by matsushita  the shinohara situation s brief was already given by matsushita","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p73-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: The secretary of the Shinohara situation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.73–74<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">AK narrates: Matsushita had already given him a brief explanation of the Shinohara fallout — he also has to hear it from Kei as well; the “Kei, Matsushita, Mori and the rest” trio — Kushida&#x27;s leak about their making fun of her appearance got behind Shinohara.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Matsushita and Mori may soon face a flipped campaign — Shinohara&#x27;s friends might openly bad-mouth “Kei, Matsushita, Mori and the rest.”<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Kei is the one whose Shinohara situation is explained in parallel by Matsushita.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> The Shinohara situation&#x27;s brief was already given by Matsushita.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p58-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Maid café; not talking to Shinohara<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p147-1\">→ After: Ch.3: The couple list — patched<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p147-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"","w":"shinohara-satsuki ike-kanji matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 3  the couple list   patched wang pov   matsushita san is among the hurting ones she asks ak about  mii chan s hurt list   shinohara san  matsushita san  and hasebe san  kushida s apology   shinohara san  matsushita san and the others  i m sorry i bothered you too  looks like you ve managed to patch things up  the patched group   keyaki mall summit   water under the bridge  kei and matsushita are both in the couple making fun crowd shinohara had cut off  kushida apologizes to her  his girlfriend   the couple at the center  anchored references   quoted corpus verbatim where shown  see rows for pages","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p147-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: The couple list — patched<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.147–179<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Anchored references — quoted corpus verbatim where shown; see rows for pages.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shinohara-satsuki.html\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/a> · <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Wang POV — Matsushita-san is among the hurting ones she asks AK about.<span class=\"pg\">p.147<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Mii-chan&#x27;s hurt list: “Shinohara-san, Matsushita-san, and Hasebe-san.”<span class=\"pg\">p.155<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Kushida&#x27;s apology: “Shinohara-san, Matsushita-san and the others, I’m sorry I bothered you too. Looks like you’ve managed to patch things up.”<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> The patched group — Keyaki Mall summit — water under the bridge; Kei and Matsushita are both in the couple-making-fun crowd Shinohara had cut off.<span class=\"pg\">p.179<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shinohara Satsuki<\/b> Kushida apologizes to her.<span class=\"pg\">p.174<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> His girlfriend — the couple at the center.<span class=\"pg\">p.179<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v6-p73-1\">← Before: Ch.2: The secretary of the Shinohara situation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p12-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"sudou-ken matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the honor roll the midterm results list  matsushita is named among the honor roll alongside yosuke  kushida and wang   the top rankers from this group were honor students such as yosuke  kushida  matsushita  and wang    the narration  the surprise in the results is sudo s  not theirs  the narration groups her with the honor roll that sudo jumped past","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The honor roll<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.12<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The midterm results list: Matsushita is named among the honor roll alongside Yōsuke, Kushida and Wang.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “The top rankers from this group were honor students such as Yōsuke, Kushida, Matsushita, and Wang” — the narration; the surprise in the results is Sudō&#x27;s, not theirs.<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> The narration groups her with the honor roll that Sudō jumped past.<span class=\"pg\">p.12<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p13-1\">→ After: The Haruka question; what Matsushita senses<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p13-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the haruka question  what matsushita senses after school  the maid cafe planners meet  matsushita asks horikita and ayanokoji about hasebe san and miyake kun  nobody says it out loud  but she is the one who voices the danger   hasebe san and miyake kun  what will you do about them    matsushita looked at horikita and ayanokoji and asked   what do you mean   what will i do    printed untagged  horikita or ayanokoji  not assigned   they come to school every day  but they don t want to talk to anyone  it means they keep antagonizing us  the whole class   i think hasebe san is going to try to do something to the class in the future    the narration   a person like matsushita would ve guessed  haruka never told her   are you saying you condone revenge    printed untagged  not assigned   of course not  i understand why she s angry  but that doesn t mean i don t mind trouble brewing in class without good reason    printed untagged  horikita or ayanokoji  not assigned   there s very little we can do in advance    printed in horikita s dialogue run  tagged  horikita said  looking off into the distance  by the adjacent narration   if she s really looking for an opportunity for revenge  she certainly won t put it off for months    printed in the same horikita run  adjacent narration ties it to horikita  flagged anyway   yeah  but we re not in a situation where that kind of logic would work  it shouldn t take this long for her to recover    printed untagged  not assigned","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p13-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The Haruka question; what Matsushita senses<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.13–14<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After school, the maid café planners meet; Matsushita asks Horikita and Ayanokōji about Hasebe-san and Miyake-kun; nobody says it out loud, but she is the one who voices the danger.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hasebe-san and Miyake-kun, what will you do about them?” — Matsushita looked at Horikita and Ayanokōji and asked.<span class=\"pg\">p.13<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“They come to school every day, but they don&#x27;t want to talk to anyone. It means they keep antagonizing us, the whole class.”<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I think Hasebe-san is going to try to do something to the class in the future.” — the narration: “a person like Matsushita would&#x27;ve guessed”; Haruka never told her.<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “What do you mean, ‘what will I do?’” — printed untagged (Horikita or Ayanokōji); not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.13–14<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Are you saying you condone revenge?” — printed untagged; not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Of course not. I understand why she&#x27;s angry, but that doesn&#x27;t mean I don&#x27;t mind trouble brewing in class without good reason.” — printed untagged (Horikita or Ayanokōji); not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “There&#x27;s very little we can do in advance” — printed in Horikita&#x27;s dialogue run, tagged “Horikita said, looking off into the distance” by the adjacent narration.<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “If she&#x27;s really looking for an opportunity for revenge, she certainly won&#x27;t put it off for months.” — printed in the same Horikita run; adjacent narration ties it to Horikita; flagged anyway.<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Yeah. But we&#x27;re not in a situation where that kind of logic would work. It shouldn&#x27;t take this long for her to recover.” — printed untagged; not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.14<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p12-1\">← Before: The honor roll<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p16-1\">→ After: Stall candidates; Hashimoto&#x27;s probe; Satō&#x27;s silence<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p16-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"hashimoto-masayoshi wang-mei-yu satou-maya matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki stall candidates  hashimoto s probe  sato s silence the group inspects floors one through three  matsushita reports two of five candidates are occupied  hashimoto  class a  appears and needles them about ryuen  sakayanagi watches with a wry smile  sato is visibly distracted   that s right  two of the five places we picked up are now occupied  however  there are still candidates from the first to the third floor  which i d say is a bit of a problem    matsushita took a peek at mii chan s phone and said this   come to think of it  sato hasn t been particularly energetic the last few days    printed untagged  matsushita or ayanokoji  not assigned   i was curious if ayanokoji kun would know anything about that  but i guess not    matsushita  if the adjacent narration  i wondered if matsushita thought i was some kind of sato whisperer  is to be trusted  flagged untagged   it s like she wants to talk but can t  she s the type of person who keeps things inside    matsushita  biting down on her lip  continued   maybe when    matsushita  a little unclear  stops talking because the conversation is possible only away from sato s vicinity   don t try to get anything out of us    matsushita stepped forward  looking the same as usual   you appear to want to say something  hashimoto kun    matsushita  standing there protecting the three girls  in a slightly irritated tone   i m worried about your class  my friend  it seems that you have teamed up with  ryuen for the sports festival  but do you think you can trust him forever    the probe that makes her hold her ground   i just thought you were going to team up with ryuen again  if you are going to team up with him  be careful  he said  as if he had the heart of an old woman   we re in a hurry  and i don t think we can play word games forever  you know  everyone    matsushita turned around and asked the girls and ayanokoji  his probing reaches her  she stays poker faced  she reports on the occupied candidates  matsushita peeks at her phone  she watches sato s unnatural quiet with concern  reports to ayanokoji that sato  keeps things inside  declines to push","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p16-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Stall candidates; Hashimoto&#x27;s probe; Satō&#x27;s silence<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.16–18<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The group inspects floors one through three; Matsushita reports two of five candidates are occupied; Hashimoto (Class A) appears and needles them about Ryūen; Sakayanagi watches with a wry smile; Satō is visibly distracted.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a> · <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“That&#x27;s right. Two of the five places we picked up are now occupied... However, there are still candidates from the first to the third floor, which I&#x27;d say is a bit of a problem.” — Matsushita took a peek at Mii-chan&#x27;s phone and…”<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It&#x27;s like she wants to talk but can&#x27;t. She&#x27;s the type of person who keeps things inside.” — Matsushita, biting down on her lip, continued.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Maybe when....” — Matsushita, a little unclear; stops talking because the conversation is possible only away from Satō&#x27;s vicinity.<span class=\"pg\">p.17<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>11 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That&#x27;s right. Two of the five places we picked up are now occupied... However, there are still candidates from the first to the third floor, which I&#x27;d say is a bit of a problem.” — Matsushita took a peek at Mii-chan&#x27;s phone and said this.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Come to think of it, Satō hasn&#x27;t been particularly energetic the last few days.” — printed untagged (Matsushita or Ayanokōji); not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “I was curious if Ayanokōji-kun would know anything about that, but I guess not.” — Matsushita, if the adjacent narration (“I wondered if Matsushita thought I was some kind of Satō whisperer”) is to be trusted; flagged untagged.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Don&#x27;t try to get anything out of us.” — Matsushita stepped forward, looking the same as usual.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You appear to want to say something, Hashimoto-kun.” — Matsushita, standing there protecting the three girls, in a slightly irritated tone.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I&#x27;m worried about your class, my friend. It seems that you have teamed up with... Ryūen for the sports festival, but do you think you can trust him forever?” — the probe that makes her hold her ground.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “I just thought you were going to team up with Ryūen again. If you are going to team up with him, be careful,” he said, as if he had the heart of an old woman.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “We&#x27;re in a hurry, and I don&#x27;t think we can play word games forever, you know? Everyone?” — Matsushita turned around and asked the girls and Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> His probing reaches her; she stays poker-faced.<span class=\"pg\">p.17–18<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> She reports on the occupied candidates; Matsushita peeks at her phone.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> She watches Satō&#x27;s unnatural quiet with concern; reports to Ayanokōji that Satō “keeps things inside”; declines to push.<span class=\"pg\">p.16–17<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p13-1\">← Before: The Haruka question; what Matsushita senses<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p19-1\">→ After: The Ryūen-leak prep; the floor vote<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p19-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the ryuen leak prep  the floor vote after hashimoto s probe  the six decide to keep moving  matsushita votes paper  second floor  the decision for the first floor is made by majority vote   hashimoto kun said something earlier  did you guys catch it    maezono says crisply  the planners feel the unease  matsushita and sato are reassured again after ayanokoji s follow up  the vote  four rocks  first floor  two papers  ayanokoji and matsushita  zero scissors  first floor  50 000 pts  wins  horikita applies immediately by phone  talk of butler cafes  cleanliness  and  eros and eroticism have been seen as important elements in art since ancient times    the planners exchanged surprised and impressed looks at the butler cafe fact","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p19-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The Ryūen-leak prep; the floor vote<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.19–22<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After Hashimoto&#x27;s probe, the six decide to keep moving; Matsushita votes paper (second floor); the decision for the first floor is made by majority vote.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Hashimoto-kun said something earlier, did you guys catch it?” — Maezono says crisply; the planners feel the unease; Matsushita and Satō are reassured again after Ayanokōji&#x27;s follow-up.<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The vote: four rocks (first floor), two papers (Ayanokōji and Matsushita), zero scissors; first floor (50,000 pts) wins; Horikita applies immediately by phone.<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Talk of butler cafés, cleanliness, and “eros and eroticism have been seen as important elements in art since ancient times” — the planners exchanged surprised and impressed looks at the butler-café fact.<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p16-1\">← Before: Stall candidates; Hashimoto&#x27;s probe; Satō&#x27;s silence<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p27-1\">→ After: The leak; Matsushita remembers Hashimoto&#x27;s probe<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p27-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the leak  matsushita remembers hashimoto s probe ike bursts in with the leak  matsushita remembered the contact from hashimoto and approaches   hey horikita san  what does he mean  it was still supposed to be a secret  right    matsushita approached us  matsushita s question forces the open conversation about ryuen s betrayal","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p27-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The leak; Matsushita remembers Hashimoto&#x27;s probe<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.27<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ike bursts in with the leak; Matsushita remembered the contact from Hashimoto and approaches.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hey Horikita-san, what does he mean? It was still supposed to be a secret, right?” — Matsushita approached us.<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Matsushita&#x27;s question forces the open conversation about Ryūen&#x27;s betrayal.<span class=\"pg\">p.27<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p19-1\">← Before: The Ryūen-leak prep; the floor vote<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p30-1\">→ After: Matsushita asks what Horikita will do<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p30-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita asks what horikita will do maezono and the others approach horikita with the bottled up anxiety and frustration spilling out  matsushita asks what horikita will do   what are you going to do  horikita san  we re pretty well prepared  aren t we    matsushita   is ryuen really going to turn his class into a maid cafe    printed untagged  maezono or yosuke  not assigned","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p30-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita asks what Horikita will do<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.30<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Maezono and the others approach Horikita with the bottled-up anxiety and frustration spilling out; Matsushita asks what Horikita will do.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“What are you going to do, Horikita-san? We&#x27;re pretty well prepared, aren&#x27;t we..?” — Matsushita.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Is Ryūen really going to turn his class into a maid café?” — printed untagged; Maezono or Yōsuke; not assigned.<span class=\"pg\">p.30<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p27-1\">← Before: The leak; Matsushita remembers Hashimoto&#x27;s probe<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p85-1\">→ After: Satō&#x27;s advocate; the trust line<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p85-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune satou-maya wang-mei-yu matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki sato s advocate  the trust line matsushita is unable to bear the sight of sato s downcast and frustrated face  she goes directly to horikita   i know what you mean  but i don t intend to remove her at the moment    horikita  on kushida   but it s a lie that she has to do things every day  isn t it    matsushita  kushida s behavior as of late has been quite puzzling  it can t be helped that she s been keeping her distance from the others since the unanimous special exam   that may be so  i don t know why she doesn t participate in practice either    horikita   don t worry  she s thinking about the festival and the maid cafe in her own way  just believe in kushida san    horikita   well  i guess you could say that we won t get anywhere if i don t believe in her    matsushita looked unconvinced  but nodded and turned to follow sato  the rehearsal  matsushita is the stabilizer of the rehearsal  she s impressed by her own performance at the rehearsal   she calms mii chan after the slip  she fears sabotage   i am terribly sorry    matsushita s instinct after mii chan s slip   thank you    matsushita to the guest s praise   you re doing very well  matsushita san  i can t believe it s your very first time as a maid    a guest to matsushita  horikita was also impressed by matsushita s outstanding actions  she holds the trust line  horikita matches her steadiness  her downcast face   the advocate for sato  she steadies mii chan after the slip","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p85-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Satō&#x27;s advocate; the trust line<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.85–86<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Matsushita is unable to bear the sight of Satō&#x27;s downcast and frustrated face; she goes directly to Horikita. The rehearsal; Matsushita is the stabilizer of the rehearsal; she&#x27;s impressed by her own performance at the rehearsal — she calms Mii-chan after the slip; she fears sabotage.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “I know what you mean. But I don&#x27;t intend to remove her at the moment.” — Horikita, on Kushida.<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “That may be so. I don&#x27;t know why she doesn&#x27;t participate in practice either.” — Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “Don&#x27;t worry. She&#x27;s thinking about the festival and the maid cafe in her own way. Just believe in Kushida-san.” — Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “But it&#x27;s a lie that she has to do things every day, isn&#x27;t it?” — Matsushita; Kushida&#x27;s behavior as of late has been quite puzzling; it can&#x27;t be helped that she&#x27;s been keeping her distance from the others since the unanimous special exam.<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Well, I guess you could say that we won&#x27;t get anywhere if I don&#x27;t believe in her...” — Matsushita looked unconvinced, but nodded and turned to follow Satō.<span class=\"pg\">p.86<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I am terribly sorry.” — Matsushita&#x27;s instinct after Mii-chan&#x27;s slip.<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Thank you.” — Matsushita to the guest&#x27;s praise.<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “You&#x27;re doing very well, Matsushita-san, I can&#x27;t believe it&#x27;s your very first time as a maid.” — a guest to Matsushita; Horikita was also impressed by Matsushita&#x27;s outstanding actions.<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She holds the trust line; Horikita matches her steadiness.<span class=\"pg\">p.85–86, 90–92<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Her downcast face — the advocate for Satō.<span class=\"pg\">p.85–86, 90<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> She steadies Mii-chan after the slip.<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p30-1\">← Before: Matsushita asks what Horikita will do<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p92-1\">→ After: The sabotage fear<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p92-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ryuuen-kakeru ishizaki-daichi ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the sabotage fear after the rehearsal winds down  matsushita rounds up the rehearsal critique  her voice is a little stiff   thanks  everyone s getting better  we should be able to start tomorrow in good shape    matsushita said  though her expression was a little stiff   i think there might be more sabotage  that s what i m a little worried about    matsushita  when ryuen kun s class came over to the maid cafe  she was afraid they d bring ishizaki kun and the others over and say there were bugs in the cups or something   don t worry about that  it s not in their best interest to interfere in the practice stage  besides  since there is a rule that students can t be guests in the activities  they can t do such a thing    horikita   i guess i ll do that    matsushita started to walk away and left the classroom  wobbling slightly  her fear  ryuen s class could sabotage with bugs in the cups claims  horikita dismisses it  named as one of the potential saboteurs she fears  ayanokoji repeats her reassurance   he may be the calmest of the three on this","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p92-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The sabotage fear<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.92<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">After the rehearsal winds down; Matsushita rounds up the rehearsal critique; her voice is a little stiff.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Thanks. Everyone&#x27;s getting better. We should be able to start tomorrow in good shape.” — Matsushita said, though her expression was a little stiff.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I think there might be more sabotage, that&#x27;s what I&#x27;m a little worried about.” — Matsushita; when Ryūen-kun&#x27;s class came over to the maid cafe, she was afraid they&#x27;d bring Ishizaki-kun and the others over and say there were bugs…”<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “Don&#x27;t worry about that. It&#x27;s not in their best interest to interfere in the practice stage. Besides, since there is a rule that students can&#x27;t be guests in the activities, they can&#x27;t do such a thing.” — Horikita.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I think there might be more sabotage, that&#x27;s what I&#x27;m a little worried about.” — Matsushita; when Ryūen-kun&#x27;s class came over to the maid cafe, she was afraid they&#x27;d bring Ishizaki-kun and the others over and say there were bugs in the cups or something...<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I guess I&#x27;ll do that.” — Matsushita started to walk away and left the classroom, wobbling slightly.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Her fear: Ryūen&#x27;s class could sabotage with bugs-in-the-cups claims; Horikita dismisses it.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Named as one of the potential saboteurs she fears.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Ayanokōji repeats her reassurance — he may be the calmest of the three on this.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p85-1\">← Before: Satō&#x27;s advocate; the trust line<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p107-1\">→ After: The illness call<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p107-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"satou-maya ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the illness call matsushita contacted ayanokoji early in the morning and reported that she had to take the day off due to illness   a cough and other symptoms  she could not perform a job that required customer service  and if the cold spread it would affect the class during the festival  she could not be entrusted with a heavy workload even if reassigned   she led the maid cafe to this point  her illness triggers the shift change discussion  sato carries the opening  the early call  he understands the need for reassignment preparation","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p107-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The illness call<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.107<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"satou-maya.html\">Satō Maya<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Matsushita contacted Ayanokōji early in the morning and reported that she had to take the day off due to illness — a cough and other symptoms; she could not perform a job that required customer service, and if the cold spread it would affect the class during the festival; she could not be entrusted with a heavy workload even if reassigned — she led the maid café to this point.<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Satō Maya<\/b> Her illness triggers the shift-change discussion; Satō carries the opening.<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The early call; he understands the need for reassignment preparation.<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p92-1\">← Before: The sabotage fear<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p110-1\">→ After: Named in the absence record<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p110-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki named in the absence record  due to matsushita s absence    the shift change discussion  she contacted him early in the morning and reported she had to take the day off due to illness  he cross checks the personnel situation against his own read","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p110-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Named in the absence record<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.110<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “due to Matsushita&#x27;s absence.” — the shift change discussion; she contacted him early in the morning and reported she had to take the day off due to illness.<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He cross-checks the personnel situation against his own read.<span class=\"pg\">p.107–110<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p107-1\">← Before: The illness call<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p131-1\">→ After: The sick substitute<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p131-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the sick substitute  the remaining three were ishikura  who had substituted for matsushita    ishikura substituted for matsushita at the festival  kushida and inogashira covered flyers  ishikura s substitution is the unacknowledged difference","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p131-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The sick substitute<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.131<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “The remaining three were Ishikura, who had substituted for Matsushita,” — Ishikura substituted for Matsushita at the festival; Kushida and Inogashira covered flyers.<span class=\"pg\">p.131<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ishikura&#x27;s substitution is the unacknowledged difference.<span class=\"pg\">p.131<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p110-1\">← Before: Named in the absence record<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p188-1\">→ After: Named as absent from the meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p188-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki named as absent from the meeting  they were the three maid cafe planners  with the exception of matsushita  who was absent due to illness    the three maid cafe planners met with horikita  matsushita absent  the meeting s agenda addressed the leak s true nature  she was not present for the confession","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p188-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Named as absent from the meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.188<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “They were the three maid cafe planners, with the exception of Matsushita, who was absent due to illness.” — the Three Maid Café Planners met with Horikita; Matsushita absent.<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The meeting&#x27;s agenda addressed the leak&#x27;s true nature; she was not present for the confession.<span class=\"pg\">p.188–190<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p131-1\">← Before: The sick substitute<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p190-1\">→ After: The sentimental exit<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p190-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the sentimental exit  yes  it s a weight off my shoulders  you guys can tell matsushita san about this    horikita s relief confession  matsushita gets informed second hand","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p190-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The sentimental exit<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.190<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> “Yes, it&#x27;s a weight off my shoulders. You guys can tell Matsushita-san about this.” — Horikita&#x27;s relief confession; Matsushita gets informed second-hand.<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v7-p188-1\">← Before: Named as absent from the meeting<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p11-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita chiaki mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mentions on pages  p 48  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">matsushita-chiaki mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.11-208<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions on pages: p.48.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.11<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p16-1\">→ After: Rated high in the anonymous evaluation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p16-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki rated high in the anonymous evaluation present in homeroom for the results and the 0 37 evaluation task  ayanokoji  listing the students he had rated highly  names  horikita  keisei  and mii chan  among  the students who have always performed well academically    he rated her high in the task","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p16-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Rated high in the anonymous evaluation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.16<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Present in homeroom for the results and the 0–37 evaluation task.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Ayanokōji, listing the students he had rated highly, names &quot;Horikita, Keisei, and Mii-chan&quot; among &quot;the students who have always performed well academically&quot; — he rated her high in the task.<span class=\"pg\">p.16<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p11-1\">← Before: matsushita-chiaki mentioned in passing<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p46-1\">→ After: Hirata&#x27;s groupmate<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p46-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki hirata s groupmate  yosuke was in the same group as matsushita","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Hirata&#x27;s groupmate<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.46–53<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> &quot;Yōsuke was in the same group as Matsushita.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p16-1\">← Before: Rated high in the anonymous evaluation<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p162-1\">→ After: The disqualified Group 15<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p162-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki the disqualified group 15 group 15  to which both mii chan and miyamoto belong  is disqualified for failing the time limit on the tour test  the members sit a study session at the inn  they miss the final free day","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p162-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The disqualified Group 15<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.162<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Group 15, to which both Mii-chan and Miyamoto belong, is disqualified for failing the time limit on the tour test; the members sit a study session at the inn; they miss the final free day.<span class=\"pg\">p.162<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v8-p46-1\">← Before: Hirata&#x27;s groupmate<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1","v":"y2v9.5","y":2,"o":26,"k":"spoken","w":"maezono ike-kanji matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita  in on maezono s ayanokoji meeting she attends maezono s secret gathering  nods along as the group questions whether ayanokoji is really just a gloomy classmate  and sides with maezono in challenging ike s defense of him   ahem  thank you everyone for gathering today   lately  you ve been talking to ayanokoji a lot  haven t you  when did you  a participant in the class s attempt to understand ayanokoji  she notes his changed interactions and presses ike on his closeness to him  attends the meeting she called  questions his recent frequent contact with ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v9_5-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita: in on Maezono&#x27;s Ayanokōji meeting<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9.5 · p.66–77<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">She attends Maezono&#x27;s secret gathering, nods along as the group questions whether Ayanokōji is really just a gloomy classmate, and sides with Maezono in challenging Ike&#x27;s defense of him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"maezono.html\">Maezono<\/a> · <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> &quot;Ahem, thank you everyone for gathering today.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Lately, you&#x27;ve been talking to Ayanokōji a lot, haven&#x27;t you? When did you...&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A participant in the class&#x27;s attempt to understand Ayanokōji; she notes his changed interactions and presses Ike on his closeness to him.<span class=\"pg\">p.66–77<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Maezono<\/b> Attends the meeting she called.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Questions his recent frequent contact with Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.69<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v10-p9-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita chiaki mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mention  locator pages  p 166 167  not line by line verified  substring false positives possible  not a scene presence  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v10-p9-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">matsushita-chiaki mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.9-235<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mention (locator pages: p.166-167; not line-by-line verified; substring false positives possible). Not a scene presence.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.9<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v10-p166-1\">→ After: Ch.6: The unexpected tapioca pearl<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v10-p166-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 6  the unexpected tapioca pearl named in turn 12   ichinose s news d1  the question  what does  tapiru  mean   he  ak and kei are nominated  he answers correctly  escaping any wrong answer  his name is among the correct students  kei answered correctly too   only ak missed  four points  the term  tapiru  is not explained on the page  the correct answer per the translation is  sipping a drink with tapioca pearls","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v10-p166-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: The unexpected tapioca pearl<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.166–167<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in turn 12 — Ichinose&#x27;s News D1, the question: what does ‘tapiru’ mean — he, AK and Kei are nominated; he answers correctly, escaping any wrong answer. His name is among the correct students; Kei answered correctly too — only AK missed; four points.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The term &#x27;tapiru&#x27; is not explained on the page; the correct answer per the translation is ‘sipping a drink with tapioca pearls.’<span class=\"pg\">p.166<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v10-p9-1\">← Before: matsushita-chiaki mentioned in passing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p46-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka karuizawa-kei yamamura-miki matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 2  the bench inside keyaki mall friday eve  a certain location inside keyaki mall  about 15 minutes after the call  matsushita arrives  excused by karuizawa for 30 minutes  they last spoke last year at this exact spot when she followed him   sorry to keep you waiting  ayanokoji kun  karuizawa san told me to contact you  what did you want to talk about   ah  now that you mention it  it might have been here  yes  this is the place   yeah  i feel like you dodged the question somewhat though  he invokes the year ago conversation  her wanting to know his true abilities  names everyone he suspects  based on the video  she breaks composure  calls it a test  and confirms the topics and members of that discussion felt off   it feels like i m being tested   since i m supposedly being tested  i ll answer seriously   that s enough  he waves off the rest  matsushita says she can feel secure about the special exam with his approval  agrees the whole class must grow  and smiles about their one day joining forces  he tells her to consider the meeting as never having happened   for now  let s pretend today s meeting didn t happen  contact me anytime  the names of the involved parties are never printed  only the fact that there was a discussion  that the participants mattered  and that its topics felt off  karuizawa told matsushita to contact him  karuizawa could step out for about 30 minutes  his information source for the names he recites  he refuses to reveal who told him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p46-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: The bench inside Keyaki Mall<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.46–48<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Friday eve; a certain location inside Keyaki Mall; about 15 minutes after the call, Matsushita arrives, excused by Karuizawa for 30 minutes; they last spoke last year at this exact spot when she followed him. He invokes the year-ago conversation (her wanting to know his true abilities); names everyone he suspects, based on the video; she breaks composure, calls it a test, and confirms the topics and members of that discussion felt off. He waves off the rest; Matsushita says she can feel secure about the special exam with his approval, agrees the whole class must grow, and smiles about their one day joining forces; he tells her to consider the meeting as never having happened.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"karuizawa-kei.html\">Karuizawa Kei<\/a> · <a href=\"yamamura-miki.html\">Yamamura Miki<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Sorry to keep you waiting, Ayanokōji-kun. Karuizawa-san told me to contact you… What did you want to talk about?”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ah… now that you mention it, it might have been here. Yes, this is the place.”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Yeah. I feel like you dodged the question somewhat though.”<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It feels like I’m being tested.”<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Since I’m supposedly being tested, I’ll answer seriously.”<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s enough.”<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “For now, let’s pretend today’s meeting didn’t happen. Contact me anytime.”<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The names of the involved parties are never printed; only the fact that there was a discussion, that the participants mattered, and that its topics felt off.<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Karuizawa Kei<\/b> Karuizawa told Matsushita to contact him; Karuizawa could step out for about 30 minutes.<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamamura Miki<\/b> His information source for the names he recites; he refuses to reveal who told him.<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p66-1\">→ After: Named in passing<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p66-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki named in passing named in passing    therefore  we could afford to have students like kushida and matsushita as substitutes  but ryuen s class was different  passing mention only  her scene entries are recorded separately in her own sections","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Named in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.66<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in passing — “Therefore, we could afford to have students like Kushida and Matsushita as substitutes, but Ryūen’s class was different.”<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only; her scene entries are recorded separately in her own sections.<span class=\"pg\">p.66<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p46-1\">← Before: Ch.2: The bench inside Keyaki Mall<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p87-1\">→ After: Ch.4: The question on everyone&#x27;s lips<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p87-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 4  the question on everyone s lips in the unfamiliar examiners  explanations in the participants  rooms  she asks the question the whole class is thinking   what are the victory conditions for the representatives   on behalf of her classmates  the examiner answers that there is no point in trying to guess  and that the answers are sealed until the exam is over  shinohara also complains here that they cannot see any progress until the exam is over  the examiner answers him without pause  the explanations rule out any guessing strategy outright","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p87-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: The question on everyone&#x27;s lips<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.87–88<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">In the unfamiliar examiners&#x27; explanations in the participants&#x27; rooms, she asks the question the whole class is thinking — what are the victory conditions for the representatives — on behalf of her classmates; the examiner answers that there is no point in trying to guess, and that the answers are sealed until the exam is over.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Shinohara also complains here that they cannot see any progress until the exam is over; the examiner answers him without pause; the explanations rule out any guessing strategy outright.<span class=\"pg\">p.88<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p66-1\">← Before: Named in passing<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p120-1\">→ After: Ch.6: Discussion participant list (Horikita vs Kanzaki)<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p120-1","v":"y2v12","y":2,"o":31,"k":"","w":"matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 6  discussion participant list  horikita vs kanzaki  named in the discussion participant list for the middle guard battle   class b side  in the calm bold poker face group  no dialogue or action is printed for her on these pages  the role is never disclosed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p120-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: Discussion participant list (Horikita vs Kanzaki)<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12 · p.120<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the discussion participant list for the middle-guard battle — Class B side, in the calm/bold/poker-face group.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No dialogue or action is printed for her on these pages; the role is never disclosed.<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12-p87-1\">← Before: Ch.4: The question on everyone&#x27;s lips<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12_5-p11-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kushida-kikyou matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 1  the class debrief after the special exam matsushita raises her hand among the three who knew about maezono and hashimoto  along with kushida and mii chan   it s because i told him  what ayanokoji kun s saying is true  there s no mistake   what do you mean by that  she backs his account of the leak before the class  both raise their hands together supporting ayanokoji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12_5-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: The class debrief after the special exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.11–22<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Matsushita raises her hand among the three who knew about Maezono and Hashimoto, along with Kushida and Mii-chan.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“It’s because I told him. What Ayanokōji-kun’s saying is true. There’s no mistake.”<span class=\"pg\">p.19<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“What do you mean by that?”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She backs his account of the leak before the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.18–19<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Both raise their hands together supporting Ayanokōji.<span class=\"pg\">p.18<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12_5-p54-1\">→ After: Ch.4: The trio at Keyaki Mall<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12_5-p54-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka wang-mei-yu onodera matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki ch 4  the trio at keyaki mall matsushita explains the trio s chance meeting  the three walk to keyaki mall together talking about sakayanagi s withdrawal   mii chan was about to go to keyaki mall  and we were meeting here  so  we thought we might as well join her   hey ayanokoji kun  did you know that sakayanagi san is withdrawing  we were just talking about that   besides  not only did the strongest enemy  class a  lose in the special exam  but there s also the bonus of sakayanagi san s withdrawal  the wind is definitely blowing in our favor   i d rather they keep falling  in terms of sheer ability  sakayanagi san s class is scary  just because the leader got expelled doesn t mean their academic abilities will drop   i ve always been the type to look at things objectively  i have to take advantage of any benefits without hesitating  it isn t an easy task to get to class a   it seems your abilities are finally being recognized  ayanokoji kun   i just had a feeling  until now  he didn t want to stand out and wasn t showing his true abilities  however  this time  he took on the general s role and delivered results  it feels like he s going full throttle from here  she reads his special exam surge correctly and praises it  the trio walks together  the trio walks together","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12_5-p54-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: The trio at Keyaki Mall<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.54–57<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Matsushita explains the trio&#x27;s chance meeting; the three walk to Keyaki Mall together talking about Sakayanagi&#x27;s withdrawal.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a> · <a href=\"onodera.html\">Onodera<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Mii-chan was about to go to Keyaki Mall, and we were meeting here. So, we thought we might as well join her.”<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hey Ayanokōji-kun, did you know that Sakayanagi-san is withdrawing? We were just talking about that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.54<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Besides, not only did the strongest enemy, Class A, lose in the special exam, but there’s also the bonus of Sakayanagi-san’s withdrawal. The wind is definitely blowing in our favor.”<span class=\"pg\">p.55<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’d rather they keep falling. In terms of sheer ability, Sakayanagi-san’s class is scary. Just because the leader got expelled doesn’t mean their academic abilities will drop.”<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’ve always been the type to look at things objectively. I have to take advantage of any benefits without hesitating. It isn’t an easy task to get to Class A.”<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It seems your abilities are finally being recognized, Ayanokōji-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I just had a feeling. Until now, he didn’t want to stand out and wasn’t showing his true abilities. However, this time, he took on the general’s role and delivered results. It feels like he’s going full throttle from here.”<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> She reads his special-exam surge correctly and praises it.<span class=\"pg\">p.54–57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> The trio walks together.<span class=\"pg\">p.54–57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Onodera<\/b> The trio walks together.<span class=\"pg\">p.54–57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y2v12_5-p11-1\">← Before: Ch.1: The class debrief after the special exam<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y3v1-p20-1","v":"y3v1","y":3,"o":33,"k":"spoken","w":"chabashira-sae matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita  flustered at the announcement raises her voice in a way unlike her  some students cannot hide their surprise at the unusual behavior   t this is a lie  right  sensei  that ayanokouji kun has transferred to class c  demands confirmation  chabashira holds that it is not a mistake","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y3v1-p20-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita, flustered at the announcement<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V1 · p.20–21<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Raises her voice in a way unlike her; some students cannot hide their surprise at the unusual behavior.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;T-This is a lie, right, Sensei? That Ayanokouji-kun has transferred to Class C…&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Demands confirmation; Chabashira holds that it is not a mistake.<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y3v1-p30-1\">→ After: Matsushita accompanies Horikita; Ayanokōji exposes their partnership<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y3v1-p30-1","v":"y3v1","y":3,"o":33,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-suzune matsushita-chiaki","q":"matsushita chiaki matsushita accompanies horikita  ayanokoji exposes their partnership  i know  you re going to see ayanokouji kun  right  let me come with you   i want to know the reason behind ayanokouji kun s transfer  just to confirm once more  this isn t part of your strategy  horikita san  right   i m just accompanying her  i m only here to convey to my class what i ve seen and heard as a normal classmate rather than a leader   oh no  ayanokouji kun  you really seem to be overestimating me  a  schemer  who values ayanokoji s abilities   accompanies horikita under the pretext of reporting to her class  but ayanokoji reveals she came to verify his true intentions and that she had cooperated with him behind the scenes  including maezono s expulsion  she can t fully hide her disturbance at the exposure  secretly cooperated with him  came to verify his reasons for transferring  accompanies her  claiming to be a neutral classmate reporter  ayanokoji calls her  one of the sharpest minds in horikita s class  usually working behind the scenes   you re okay with not answering anything  ayanokouji kun  you ll be treated as a traitor  you know  her persistence produces the only answer he gives   that there is nothing more to say  horikita gives up and leaves","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y3v1-p30-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Matsushita accompanies Horikita; Ayanokōji exposes their partnership<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V1 · p.30–39<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I know. You&#x27;re going to see Ayanokouji-kun, right? Let me come with you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;…I want to know the reason behind Ayanokouji-kun&#x27;s transfer. Just to confirm once more, this isn&#x27;t part of your strategy, Horikita-san, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.31<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;m just accompanying her. I&#x27;m only here to convey to my class what I&#x27;ve seen and heard as a normal classmate rather than a leader.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Oh no, Ayanokouji-kun, you really seem to be overestimating me.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> A &quot;schemer&quot; who values Ayanokōji&#x27;s abilities — accompanies Horikita under the pretext of reporting to her class, but Ayanokōji reveals she came to verify his true intentions and that she had cooperated with him behind the scenes (including Maezono&#x27;s expulsion); she can&#x27;t fully hide her disturbance at the exposure.<span class=\"pg\">p.30–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> secretly cooperated with him; came to verify his reasons for transferring.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Accompanies her, claiming to be a neutral classmate reporter.<span class=\"pg\">p.31–36<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji calls her &quot;one of the sharpest minds in Horikita&#x27;s class,&quot; usually working behind the scenes.<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You&#x27;re okay with not answering anything? Ayanokouji-kun, you&#x27;ll be treated as a traitor, you know?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Her persistence produces the only answer he gives — that there is nothing more to say; Horikita gives up and leaves.<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-matsushita-chiaki-y3v1-p20-1\">← Before: Matsushita, flustered at the announcement<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
